From e46a1de1e79f4a2b7888118daaaf779c2ca299c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Norquist <norquistdylan@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 18:11:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] mla: decode fp8_ds_mla cache with Triton

Teach the dense Triton MLA backend to allocate and decode Kimi-K3's 656-byte block-scaled cache while preserving BF16 RoPE values. Cover the packed cache geometry and decode numerics.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: Dylan Norquist <norquistdylan@gmail.com>
---
 .../attention/test_triton_decode_attention.py | 103 ++++++++++++++++++
 vllm/v1/attention/backends/mla/triton_mla.py  |  19 +++-
 .../attention/ops/triton_decode_attention.py  |  54 +++++++--
 3 files changed, 163 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/kernels/attention/test_triton_decode_attention.py b/tests/kernels/attention/test_triton_decode_attention.py
